#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information about IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud logging"
msgstr "Maklumat tentang pengelogan IBM Quantum pada IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Logging for Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Pengelogan untuk Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as Qiskit Runtime, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum Compute Service, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan IBM Cloud&reg;, seperti Qiskit Runtime, menjana log platform yang boleh anda gunakan untuk menyiasat aktiviti luar biasa dan tindakan kritikal dalam akaun anda, serta menyelesaikan masalah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan [IBM Cloud Logs Routing,](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about) iaitu perkhidmatan platform, untuk menghalakan log platform dalam akaun anda ke destinasi pilihan anda dengan mengkonfigurasi penyewa yang menentukan ke mana log platform dihantar. Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat [Tentang Logs Routing.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) untuk menvisualisasikan dan memberi amaran tentang log platform yang dijana dalam akaun anda dan dihalakan oleh IBM Cloud Logs Routing ke instans IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"
msgstr "Lokasi di mana log platform dijana {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud Container Registry menjana log platform yang dipaparkan dalam instans pengelogan anda. Jadual berikut menyenaraikan lokasi di mana pengumpulan automatik log perkhidmatan Container Registry didayakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Lokasi                   | Adakah log perkhidmatan platform tersedia? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Ya                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Ya                  |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Platform logs that are generated {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"
msgstr "Log platform yang dijana {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "IBM Qiskit Runtime generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgstr "IBM Qiskit Runtime menjana log perkhidmatan platform yang dipaparkan dalam instans pengelogan anda untuk kes-kes tertentu berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the state of a job changes.\n"
msgstr "Apabila status kerja berubah.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing logs from the Observability page {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Melihat log daripada halaman Pemerhatian {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about launching the IBM Cloud Logs interface, see **Launching the UI** in the [IBM Cloud Logs documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"
msgstr "Untuk maklumat tentang melancarkan antara muka IBM Cloud Logs, lihat **Melancarkan UI** dalam [dokumentasi IBM Cloud Logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields by log type {#fields-by-log-type}"
msgstr "Medan mengikut jenis log {#fields-by-log-type}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr "Untuk maklumat tentang medan yang disertakan dalam setiap log platform, lihat [Medan yang disertakan dalam log platform.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "Medan-medan berikut disertakan dalam rekod log.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Medan           | Jenis     | Penerangan                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Diperlukan | Menentukan akaun dan instans log aliran di mana log diterbitkan.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Diperlukan | Menentukan sama ada IBM menyimpan salinan rekod untuk tujuan operasi. |\n"
"| message         | Diperlukan | Penerangan log yang dijana.                                |\n"
